            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for a beard, then the Marathi for a moustache."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: तळहात",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तळहात — taḷhāt — \"the palm\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आजीने माझ्या तळहातावर साखर ठेवली. ājīne mājhyā taḷhātāvar sākhar ṭhevlī. Grandmother put some sugar on my palm."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तळ, the base or flat, + हात. The sole of the foot is तळपाय."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तळहात (taḷhāt) is a Marathi compound of तळ, \"base, flat\", and हात, \"hand\", a tadbhava of Sanskrit hasta (CDIAL 14024)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
